---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms and Conditions | 16-0 Play" description="Terms for using the 16-0 Play cricket strategy game, site and leaderboard.">
  <Fragment slot="head"><link rel="canonical" href="https://16-0play.com/terms-and-conditions/" /></Fragment>
  <article class="w-full px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-ink)] sm:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-body)]">These terms cover your use of the 16-0 Play website, game modes and leaderboard.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-mute)]">Last updated <time datetime="2026-09-29">September 29, 2026</time></p>
      </header>

      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-base leading-7 text-[var(--color-body)]">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Using the site</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">By using 16-0 Play, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, stop using the site. You must use the game lawfully and must not interfere with its operation, attempt to access systems without permission, or disrupt other players.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">The game and leaderboard</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">16-0 Play is a cricket simulation for entertainment. Match outcomes and ratings are generated by the game and are not official records or predictions. Leaderboard entries use a generated handle and game-run information. Do not submit another person's identifying information or try to manipulate, disrupt or gain unauthorized access to the leaderboard.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Our content</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The site, its software, design and original content belong to 16-0 Play or its respective rights holders. You may use the site for personal, lawful play. You may not copy, republish or commercially exploit site content or software without permission, except where applicable law allows it.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Player, team and competition names or statistics may belong to their respective owners. 16-0 Play is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the IPL, a cricket board, team or player.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Third-party services and links</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Some features rely on third-party services, including hosting, analytics, advertising, contact-form delivery and multiplayer connections. Those services have their own terms and privacy practices. We are not responsible for services or sites we do not operate.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Availability and changes</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may change, suspend or remove a feature, and we may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use after a revised version is posted means you accept the revised terms. The date above identifies the latest revision.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">No warranty</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The site and game are provided as available. To the extent permitted by law, we make no guarantee that the site will always be available, error-free or suitable for a particular purpose. These terms do not limit any rights that cannot legally be excluded.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Questions about these terms? Email <a class="font-medium text-[var(--color-link)] underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--color-link-deep)]" href="mailto:curatedclass13@gmail.com">curatedclass13@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
